{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone-Locked is a first person shooter with emphasis on exploration and secret hunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A short adventure, the game can be completed in a single sitting or played in smaller sessions, manually saving your progress along the way at save stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Survive Drone attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee or fight against autonomous Drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Uncover the mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through the adventure exploring the environment and finding clues to help complete your objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you discover the two unique playable ending levels?\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017140?t=1761119914","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017140?t=1761119914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017140/0d5cf6e85988d8b7927c8d1fdb5572cfa19f1f44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761119914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017140/0d5cf6e85988d8b7927c8d1fdb5572cfa19f1f44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761119914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drone-Locked is a first person shooter with emphasis on exploration and secret hunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A short adventure, the game can be completed in a single sitting or played in smaller sessions, manually saving your progress along the way at save stations.</p><p class=\"bb